{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Rose Of Wind</i> \u2014 a medieval tavern management simulator where you are tasked with reviving a legendary establishment and restoring its former glory! After your grandfather's passing, the tavern remained abandoned for a long time, and now it's time to fill it with life, warmth, and atmosphere once again.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/c132ad3d3deb13c3cb8a91c4b9033694.poster.avif?t=1759090967\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/c132ad3d3deb13c3cb8a91c4b9033694.webm?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/c132ad3d3deb13c3cb8a91c4b9033694.mp4?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Serve Visitors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each visitor brings a new story. Treat them to delicious food, offer a warm bed, engage in conversation, or simply provide a cozy corner for rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/76fda427d3c821ea1f3b19171a4c6905.poster.avif?t=1759090967\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/76fda427d3c821ea1f3b19171a4c6905.webm?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/76fda427d3c821ea1f3b19171a4c6905.mp4?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare Dishes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your kitchen, discover new recipes for dishes and drinks, and enhance them with unique ingredients. Create exquisite meals that will become the hallmark of your tavern.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/3ab272f1b53ad80a7a3bf629ca83a4a8.poster.avif?t=1759090967\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/3ab272f1b53ad80a7a3bf629ca83a4a8.webm?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/3ab272f1b53ad80a7a3bf629ca83a4a8.mp4?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brew Beverages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew alcoholic drinks, create unique cocktails and elixirs that will delight your guests. A new recipe means new opportunities to attract customers.\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Delivery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the tavern's basement lies a peculiar place \u2014 a riverside dock where you receive supplies. Through it, you order everything you need: ingredients, wax for lighting the halls, coal for stoves and the distillery, as well as tools to repair furniture that guests might damage \u2014 accidentally or intentionally.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/fb370bd6ab047ca3463553494af520de.poster.avif?t=1759090967\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/fb370bd6ab047ca3463553494af520de.webm?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/fb370bd6ab047ca3463553494af520de.mp4?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hotel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop the inn within the tavern. Add new rooms, upgrade them, and monitor their condition. A cozy lodging becomes another source of income and unique events.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/b168d0eaa1d7775aa1a944dde3fed7a8.poster.avif?t=1759090967\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/b168d0eaa1d7775aa1a944dde3fed7a8.webm?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/b168d0eaa1d7775aa1a944dde3fed7a8.mp4?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a unique atmosphere in the tavern by changing its exterior and interior. Make your tavern truly memorable \u2014 a cozy home for all.\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Airship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An airship regularly flies over the city, announcing events from the outside world: holidays, weather changes, and other news that can influence visitor behavior and mood. Listen carefully \u2014 these signals will help you prepare in advance!\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/97bf91836fd24f178772cb6f086b4ca9.poster.avif?t=1759090967\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/97bf91836fd24f178772cb6f086b4ca9.webm?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/97bf91836fd24f178772cb6f086b4ca9.mp4?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the medieval world, manage every aspect of the tavern, and create a place that attracts both locals and travelers from around the world. Can you restore your tavern's former glory and become a legend among adventurers, merchants, and travelers?\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who knows what secrets the old tavern holds?\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you uncover them all? Explore the stylized medieval world, manage every aspect of the establishment, and create a place where both locals and wandering souls will gather. Restore <i>Rose Of Wind</i> to its legendary glory and become part of a new story!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The first toast!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610700/f340c104be209280d6075d86e52e3b18d76b3917.jpg"},{"name":"Warm welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610700/e3b8971b3d99a91ff4820bd69a010ff4327fadf0.jpg"},{"name":"Sommelier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610700/cd9fc1f0bc6b6f48833d3f448c6ad35240c0d6a0.jpg"},{"name":"The chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610700/4b13878bd607bd183356b42c736e7107eed3e958.jpg"},{"name":"The innkeeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610700/6e7c6190f83d39b11c72f8c4aae014ad2d2f3eec.jpg"},{"name":"We live richly!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610700/908a8757e12793a113853af643ffb9c99e517dbf.jpg"},{"name":"The provident","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610700/4841ff3e77954fbefa81fd201815e30411a857f9.jpg"},{"name":"The tavern is great","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610700/e4d0914eb81a074e8dd45383f78b68f18218799c.jpg"},{"name":"The legends back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610700/886367728034d3d9fb3d46bb21c75abd90b23d8d.jpg"},{"name":"Designer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610700/d20a0aad5f8e103b78d96407ea1b60d3ff1ffa83.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610700?t=1759090967","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/2f1ff6010aefa68d47b93acf41e9c50e5f8c7d23/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759090967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/242043793883e76a4f6965ac581ef08d19597aaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759090967","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/242043793883e76a4f6965ac581ef08d19597aaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759090967","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Rose Of Wind</i> \u2014 a medieval tavern management simulator where you are tasked with reviving a legendary establishment and restoring its former glory! After your grandfather's passing, the tavern remained abandoned for a long time, and now it's time to fill it with life, warmth, and atmosphere once again.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/c132ad3d3deb13c3cb8a91c4b9033694.poster.avif?t=1759090967\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/c132ad3d3deb13c3cb8a91c4b9033694.webm?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/c132ad3d3deb13c3cb8a91c4b9033694.mp4?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Serve Visitors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each visitor brings a new story. Treat them to delicious food, offer a warm bed, engage in conversation, or simply provide a cozy corner for rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/76fda427d3c821ea1f3b19171a4c6905.poster.avif?t=1759090967\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/76fda427d3c821ea1f3b19171a4c6905.webm?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/76fda427d3c821ea1f3b19171a4c6905.mp4?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare Dishes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your kitchen, discover new recipes for dishes and drinks, and enhance them with unique ingredients. Create exquisite meals that will become the hallmark of your tavern.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/3ab272f1b53ad80a7a3bf629ca83a4a8.poster.avif?t=1759090967\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/3ab272f1b53ad80a7a3bf629ca83a4a8.webm?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/3ab272f1b53ad80a7a3bf629ca83a4a8.mp4?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brew Beverages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew alcoholic drinks, create unique cocktails and elixirs that will delight your guests. A new recipe means new opportunities to attract customers.\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Delivery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the tavern's basement lies a peculiar place \u2014 a riverside dock where you receive supplies. Through it, you order everything you need: ingredients, wax for lighting the halls, coal for stoves and the distillery, as well as tools to repair furniture that guests might damage \u2014 accidentally or intentionally.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/fb370bd6ab047ca3463553494af520de.poster.avif?t=1759090967\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/fb370bd6ab047ca3463553494af520de.webm?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/fb370bd6ab047ca3463553494af520de.mp4?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hotel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop the inn within the tavern. Add new rooms, upgrade them, and monitor their condition. A cozy lodging becomes another source of income and unique events.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/b168d0eaa1d7775aa1a944dde3fed7a8.poster.avif?t=1759090967\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/b168d0eaa1d7775aa1a944dde3fed7a8.webm?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/b168d0eaa1d7775aa1a944dde3fed7a8.mp4?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a unique atmosphere in the tavern by changing its exterior and interior. Make your tavern truly memorable \u2014 a cozy home for all.\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Airship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An airship regularly flies over the city, announcing events from the outside world: holidays, weather changes, and other news that can influence visitor behavior and mood. Listen carefully \u2014 these signals will help you prepare in advance!\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/97bf91836fd24f178772cb6f086b4ca9.poster.avif?t=1759090967\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/97bf91836fd24f178772cb6f086b4ca9.webm?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/extras/97bf91836fd24f178772cb6f086b4ca9.mp4?t=1759090967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the medieval world, manage every aspect of the tavern, and create a place that attracts both locals and travelers from around the world. Can you restore your tavern's former glory and become a legend among adventurers, merchants, and travelers?\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who knows what secrets the old tavern holds?\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you uncover them all? Explore the stylized medieval world, manage every aspect of the establishment, and create a place where both locals and wandering souls will gather. Restore <i>Rose Of Wind</i> to its legendary glory and become part of a new story!</p>","developers":["GSG Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610700/007bb53d2ee04798d73ac7861edf1f775408d349/header.jpg?t=1759090967","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610700/12389184/20b1692dcad93d5b1e2fff389a7cb49c800b6f3c/1755985340/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756952208","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610700/12389184/20b1692dcad93d5b1e2fff389a7cb49c800b6f3c/1755985340/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756952208","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610700/12389184/20b1692dcad93d5b1e2fff389a7cb49c800b6f3c/1755985340/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756952208","id":257187781,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187781/movie480.mp4?t=1756952208","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187781/movie_max.mp4?t=1756952208"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer | Rose Of Wind","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187781/869177126d1ee81179d8db606e415e65633df9fc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756952208","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187781/movie480_vp9.webm